// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 3 
// DisplayName :
"P924635081" "Aberrant Tech"
// DisplayTabName :
"P1619415391" "Base"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P3248912838" "Arachnos Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P279870503" "This device pulses in your hand, almost as if it were alive. Arachnos has been known to cobble together minions from both organic and technological components; perhaps they've finally breached the barrier between life and machinery."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 4 
// DisplayName :
"P1054904359" "Aeon Tech"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P2004872786" "Gold Brickers Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P796042547" "Dr. Aeon is a genius, and an evil genius to boot. These designs, smuggled out of his lab, are look like an advancement in power systems."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 5 
// DisplayName :
"P1185579963" "Amulet"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P2767011976" "Arcane Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P4185152333" "The runes around this stone make it a powerful source of protection against dark magic."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 6 
// DisplayName :
"P330272571" "Ancestral Weapon"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P3831128905" "Tsoo Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2339534949" "The Tsoo draw much of their power from the ancestral spirits they summon. It is likely that one such ancestor forged this blade in life, making it a potent weapon as well as a treasured heirloom among the Tsoo."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 7 
// DisplayName :
"P383295340" "Ancient Weapon"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P3660981397" "Warriors Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P5733292" "This dagger glows with a sickly light. Few of the weapons the Warriors wield are magical, but the gang has been accused of spreading cursed relics throughout Paragon City. This blade could be one such item."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 8 
// DisplayName :
"P2325458820" "Arachnoid Blood"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P1584805743" "Arachnoid Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P615828532" "The Arachnoids' misshapen bodies and diminished mental capacity are enough to inspire pity in most of the Rogue Isles' hardened adventurers, though in some they inspire merely curiosity. Lord Recluse allows only handpicked personnel to study the creatures"
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 9 
// DisplayName :
"P451740639" "Arachnoid Venom"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2881069983" "The spittle of the deadly Arachnoids contains proteins and enzymes unknown to modern science."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 10 
// DisplayName :
"P2674154076" "Arachnos Gun"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2850594064" "Though broken in battle, this firearm still holds many of the secrets to Arachnos' weapons technology. Lord Recluse wouldn't hesitate to kill an adventurer who was found with this weapon on his person."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 11 
// DisplayName :
"P567357687" "Arcane Essence"
// DisplayTabName :
"P3406767092" "Component"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P1662345164" "Arcane Component"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2133892191" "This reeks of mystic power."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 12 
// DisplayName :
"P2961385226" "Arcane Glyph"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1502475235" "Magical energy is locked in the twisting curves of this symbol."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 13 
// DisplayName :
"P2604785541" "Arcane Powder"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1447008658" "This fine powder is used in the creation of the tattoos that adorn the Tsoo's Yellow Ink Men. These tattoos give them enhanced mental powers, allowing them to dominate their foes."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 14 
// DisplayName :
"P3382921059" "Armor Shard"
// DisplayHelp :
"P195827925" "Arachnos armor is made from an advanced polyresin that dissipates impacts and even resists most bullets. Analysis may reveal more features added by Arachnos' dedicated researchers."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 15 
// DisplayName :
"P4046414748" "Astrology Book"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P631749936" "Special Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3951802985" "This tome, penned in the early sixth century, insists that insight and understanding of world can be found in the stars."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 16 
// DisplayName :
"P4111702886" "Steam Powered Engine"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P3860014564" "Nemesis Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1536261125" "Nemesis began life as a toymaker, but his engineering talents made him into a general."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 17 
// DisplayName :
"P135713225" "Bio Sample"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P1088799732" "Generic Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1811776987" "This odd tissue sample has been mutated beyond recognition. It would be quite useful to find out how."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 18 
// DisplayName :
"P3019738836" "Black Box"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P3695501446" "Tech Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2006539951" "You've yet to pierce the cover of this mysterious black box. Evidently, the person who designed it took pains to conceal its purpose."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 19 
// DisplayName :
"P1251915189" "Black Market Super Gear"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P3575542623" "Family Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3712418724" "The Family brings all sorts of illegal goods into Paragon City through Independence Port. Gear like this is just one of their many illicit money makers."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 20 
// DisplayName :
"P2067612791" "Blaster Tech"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3506530058" "This energy weapon appears to be an enhanced version of the rifles carried by the Wolf Spiders. Though this prototype isn't functional, it could provide valuable clues to the next direction for Arachnos technology."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 21 
// DisplayName :
"P2181873660" "Blood Sample"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P940897979" "Common Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3876425306" "Getting a blood sample from the strange groups that roam the area isn't always easy, but it often yields astonishing results."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 22 
// DisplayName :
"P743314323" "Body Armor Fragment"
// DisplayHelp :
"P593872839" "The best advanced polymer armor on the Eastern seaboard is manufactured by Crey Technologies, but many groups seem to get their hands on it."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 23 
// DisplayName :
"P1745340769" "Bone Fragment"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P3016590540" "Shivan Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P4259837970" "The bones of the dead are somehow absorbed into the Shivans' energy-laded ectoplasm. Study these shards for trace radiation and you'll learn much about these otherworldly invaders."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 24 
// DisplayName :
"P1195130831" "Book Of Blood"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P1409960104" "Cabal Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2717395921" "This spell book is written in the blood of the Red Caps, the Cabal's eternal enemies."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 25 
// DisplayName :
"P533386118" "Bracer"
// DisplayHelp :
"P28324357" "From the runes, it seems clear that this bracer has magical properties. It is not known where the Warriors get their steady supply of illegal artifacts, but some have theorized that it is at the hands of a demon."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 26 
// DisplayName :
"P1678686785" "Broken Crey Pistol"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P2511082440" "Crey Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P747276855" "This Crey Cryo pistol was damaged in a fight, but its parts are still useful."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 27 
// DisplayName :
"P1755034351" "Broken Crey Rifle"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3491938195" "It's strange how many similarities there are between Crey rifles and the weapons recovered from defeated Rikti soldiers. The study of Rikti technology is illegal, but that wouldn't stop Crey if they thought it could give them an edge."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 28 
// DisplayName :
"P3454805889" "Broken Mask"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P981778412" "Banished Pantheon Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2696586334" "At the moment, this ritual mask is small enough to fit in your hands. When animated by a member of the Banished Pantheon, such masks become greatly enlarged, and glow with an unearthly light."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 29 
// DisplayName :
"P3701601447" "Broken Rikti Weapon"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P3419041903" "Rikti Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2745790732" "Some people suspect that the Rikti have allowed their weapons to fall into the hands of human arms dealers, in order to influence weapons design and encourage companies to produce the replacement parts they need. Certain parts of this broken rifle seem to"
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 30 
// DisplayName :
"P1550517049" "Carapace"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2007916853" "The hard exterior shells of these Arachnoids have been rumored to stop bullets."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 31 
// DisplayName :
"P1881134402" "Ceramic Compound"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1498111177" "Ceramic alloys such as this are used in everything from simple weapons to sophisticated robots."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 32 
// DisplayName :
"P1090301422" "Charm"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P3413925516" "Circle of Thorns Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1055262159" "The ancient symbol on this charm is one of protection, often pictured on relics from the Oranbegan era."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 33 
// DisplayName :
"P3552710929" "CIA Files"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1601388690" "Although years old, these pre-war CIA files reveals the identities of many heroes and villains. Valuable information indeed."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 34 
// DisplayName :
"P1538237682" "Claw"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P162661967" "Wailers Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3639462947" "This Wailer claw is sharp and tinged a sickly red color, as though it has been used to slice through flesh."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 35 
// DisplayName :
"P1301082900" "Cloak"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1512390006" "The inks in which the Circle dyes their cloaks are said to have protective properties."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 36 
// DisplayName :
"P3477120209" "Coins"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P3403804266" "Red Cap Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2263384820" "Who mints the bizarre coins of the Red Caps? What sinister council ordains their creation?"
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 37 
// DisplayName :
"P3050669491" "Communication Device"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3719046200" "These communication devices are more sophisticated than anything carried by the U.S. military. They automatically scramble any message so that only Crey agents can understand it."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 38 
// DisplayName :
"P1036150391" "Coralax Hybrid Blood"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P4107742151" "Coralax Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2079888581" "How were these once ordinary men and women transformed into monstrous creatures? An analysis of their DNA may produce answers."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 39 
// DisplayName :
"P311266555" "Coral Shard"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2138796605" "When you clutch this coral shard in your hand, you feel an energy coursing through you. There is definitely something strange about these shards, which explains why everyone on Sharkhead Isle wants to get their hands on them."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 40 
// DisplayName :
"P363127559" "Cortex Device"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1137061290" "This device has been engineered to issue commands to hundreds of Rikti Drones at once. Scientists believe that such a device must contain a highly sophisticated artificial intelligence, capable of adapting to new combat situations with ease."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 41 
// DisplayName :
"P3704352254" "Crey Tech"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3767007270" "These documents, smuggled out of Crey Industries, seem to deal with human memory and ways of altering it. They suggest that experiments are already well underway."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 42 
// DisplayName :
"P4240649529" "Crystal Codex Fragments"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3976716662" "It is said the Crystal Codex was written in the language of the gods. Indeed, the shards seem capable of trapping immense power within them."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 43 
// DisplayName :
"P3909452096" "Crystal Skull"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P2013879531" "Skull Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P69942524" "Somehow this artifact takes power from the spirits of the dead and channels it into the Skulls' dark attacks."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 44 
// DisplayName :
"P1376229089" "Cybernetic Charger"
// DisplayHelp :
"P24756656" "This device allows the body to produce energy and store it for use later. Such devices have been used by the Freakshow, and sold by the Family."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 45 
// DisplayName :
"P1172752078" "Cybernetic Implant"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P3329363118" "Vahzilok Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P4160972167" "This frightening looking device is used by the Vahzilok to fuse healthy organs to dead human tissue."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 46 
// DisplayName :
"P622192928" "Demon Heart"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2770809953" "Torn from the breast of a foul creature, this still reeks with vile steam. Powerful mystics agree that there are only two final ways of eliminating a demon: ripping out its heart, or learning its true name."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 47 
// DisplayName :
"P688607326" "Demonic Chain"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1464681436" "Circle mystics use these chains to bind the demons they summon."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 48 
// DisplayName :
"P3434162889" "Dagger"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2386516452" "This softly glowing dagger was used to draw the blood for a demon's tribute."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 49 
// DisplayName :
"P986897842" "Dangerous Chemicals"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2848351517" "Normally, possession of these chemicals requires a special license. Of course, that doesn't stop groups like the Council from using them for everything from powering their flamethrowers to lubricating their robots' circuitry."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 50 
// DisplayName :
"P1013063430" "Data Files"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P2718976052" "The Family Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3946881396" "These discs don't look like much, but someone took a lot of effort to encrypt the files on them. The Family is involved in all sorts of illegal deals, most notably Superadine dealing, so the info on these discs could be valuable indeed."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 51 
// DisplayName :
"P3027275499" "Demonlogica"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1986068570" "It is well known within the mystic community that the author of this book lost his mind just after completing it."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 52 
// DisplayName :
"P4098321958" "Devouring Culture"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P2939183641" "Devouring Earth Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2608066766" "This bioluminescent specimen is unlike any living thing you've ever seen. The Devouring Earth are always mutating at a frightening rate."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 53 
// DisplayName :
"P3961148413" "DNA Mutation"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2135093551" "The DNA strands suspended in this vial contain the secrets of Rikti genetics. Although it may be years before scientists have fully decoded the Rikti genome, there have already been astounding leaps in our understanding of these aliens."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 54 
// DisplayName :
"P2399594563" "Dread Tramalian"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P2171402537" "Legacy Chain Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P970360807" "Rings such as these are passed down through the Legacy Cahin, from father to son. They are half ward, half heirloom."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 55 
// DisplayName :
"P350811116" "Ebon Claw"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2808438946" "This Ebon Claw is the grisly remains of a demon once bound to the Circle of Thorns, now banished to the netherworld."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 56 
// DisplayName :
"P2104421565" "EChip"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3465648611" "This microchip is quite sophisticated. It's amusing that the noble Freedom Corps and the ruthless Knives of Artemis put it to almost the exact same use."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 57 
// DisplayName :
"P1003193018" "Ectoplasm"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3682434187" "Some call it 'ectoplasm.' Others call it 'spectral blood.' Whatever the case, the properties of this rare ooze have only begun to be discovered."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 58 
// DisplayName :
"P979254898" "Ectoplasmic Residue"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1933048273" "Wherever ghosts appear, this residue is left behind. It has been put to all manner of uses, including contacting the dead."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 59 
// DisplayName :
"P374560704" "Elemental Manual"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2760153307" "Tomes like these are commonly found among the Legacy Chain. They contain a mishmash of spells and diary entries dating centuries back."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 60 
// DisplayName :
"P2950657552" "Enchanted Weapon"
// DisplayHelp :
"P607190517" "It is rumored that not all the Tsoo's summoned ancestors roam free. Some are thought to inhabit weapons like this, increasing their deadliness tenfold."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 61 
// DisplayName :
"P281948255" "Energy Source"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P2346938694" "Freakshow Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1021074718" "It looks like a battery, but the energy it puts out is off the chart."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 62 
// DisplayName :
"P1316395580" "Etherium"
// DisplayHelp :
"P4101953138" "Soft as cloth, this woven metal shimmers with a strange glow. It is almost as though it comes from another world entirely."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 63 
// DisplayName :
"P4128449845" "Exotic Alloy"
// DisplayHelp :
"P992797030" "This metal is light as a feather but harder than anything you've ever seen. Highly useful, especially for weapons."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 64 
// DisplayName :
"P2103762976" "Exotic Compound"
// DisplayHelp :
"P742649780" "This concoction looks like the work of a crazed alchemist."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 65 
// DisplayName :
"P701154878" "Experimental Tech"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P2835888488" "Technological Component"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2388460445" "These hardware utilizes some very advanced and untested theories."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 66 
// DisplayName :
"P1954965351" "Fa'Lak Amulet"
// DisplayHelp :
"P873549497" "Fa'Lak amulets protect the bearer against harm from mystical sources. Many members of the Legacy Chain carry them -- often not for themselves, but for the people they wish to protect."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 67 
// DisplayName :
"P3711022292" "Fetish"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P1082210850" "BanishedPantheon Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P4274295666" "It doesn't make sense that a simple stick like this could have the power to blur the barrier between the spirit world and this one, allowing the dark powers of the Banished Pantheon to bleed through. It doesn't make sense, but it's true."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 68 
// DisplayName :
"P104554076" "Fir Bolg Straw"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P2513311991" "Fir Bolg Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P781721504" "Scarecrows walking and talking? Balderdash! It's just straw, right?"
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 69 
// DisplayName :
"P4133569588" "Fish Scale"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3154994206" "The fish that could grow a scale this size must be a truly frightening specimen. Even more frightening is the fact that the Coralax evidently took it down."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 70 
// DisplayName :
"P821477517" "Freakshow Cybernetics"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2156698915" "Freakshow gear may be garage built, but their designs are still advanced."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 71 
// DisplayName :
"P1391606986" "Tuatha Furs"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P1491583884" "Tuatha Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P215515447" "The furs of these proud beasts bear an unusual scent, the artifact of their origins in the spirit realm."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 72 
// DisplayName :
"P1470422936" "Hydra DNA Sample"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P1823767542" "Hydra Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1155650624" "It's marked "Tissue Sample: Subject Unclassifiable." It could be interesting."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 73 
// DisplayName :
"P3195313417" "Ghost Trinket"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P4140688404" "Ghost Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3747740919" "Small possessions of the spirits sometimes manifest and drop into the physical world. Studying these transmogrified relics often yields fascinating results."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 74 
// DisplayName :
"P503442773" "Glittershrooms"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1061794942" "These once-normal mushrooms became enchanted when accidentally caught in a Tuatha's spell. Their properties are varied, but always yield fascinating results to those who know how to study them."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 75 
// DisplayName :
"P4082107612" "Golden Skin"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1211593585" "This fragment of golden skin may reveal something about the true nature of the Gold Brickers' leader, King Midas."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 76 
// DisplayName :
"P1053258906" "Graphite Composite"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2876448385" "Stronger than steel and more flexible, new uses are being found for this material every day. Arachnos uses it in the carapaces for their deadly Tarantulas, while the heroic group Wyvern uses it in the construction of trick arrows."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 77 
// DisplayName :
"P2369779977" "Hamidon Lichen"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2434818486" "The bright orange color of this lichen indicates that, like many Devouring Earth creatures, this lichen has undergone strange mutations."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 78 
// DisplayName :
"P1309185966" "Hamidon Spore"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2783441233" "The spore from this monstrous creature is highly complex, and totally unlike any plant or animal known to man."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 79 
// DisplayName :
"P96966178" "Hatchet"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P258619004" "Unused Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3357538033" "Advanced weaponry can be very effective, but there are some groups that actually prefer the simple brutality of handheld weapons."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 80 
// DisplayName :
"P3153246446" "Headset"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P1190239780" "Wyvern Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P4073219195" "This headset uses sophisticated scrambling technology so that messages can only be picked up by those with identical equipment."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 81 
// DisplayName :
"P1100156606" "Hellish Tooth"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P2354980610" "Nerva Demon Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3999253666" "The flesh speared on these jagged teeth is black and smells of sulfur. Perhaps it comes from whatever hellish beasts roam the Nerva demons' home dimension."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 82 
// DisplayName :
"P3348915078" "Hex"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P2552126252" "Hellion Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1995546940" "Though largely unschooled in the ways of magic, the Hellions have deciphered a few symbols of power. Their ignorance of the craft makes their use of such symbols all the more dangerous."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 83 
// DisplayName :
"P2342262027" "Ice Shard"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P4133919390" "Winter Horde Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3500698155" "No heat can melt this ice, an artifact of the Winter Lord's assault on Paragon City."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 84 
// DisplayName :
"P682973754" "Innovative Code"
// DisplayHelp :
"P330790416" "In this modern age, the Family isn't restricted to dealing in guns and Superadine. They do a brisk business in illegal software as well."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 85 
// DisplayName :
"P3843098304" "Kheldian Blood Sample"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P873460386" "Kheldians Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2890119370" "Though merged with aliens, Khelidians still bleed. Their blood seems to have a strange texture to it, and the color isn't quite normal."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 86 
// DisplayName :
"P2250867087" "Kheldian Tech"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2309133570" "This technology is sleek and sophisticated, but almost impossible to guess the purpose of. Truly, this is the work of alien minds."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 87 
// DisplayName :
"P2364037117" "Lens"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2962943823" "This is an very fine lens ground from some pure crystal. Often used in the targeting sights of quantum guns and other weapons, such lenses are quite valuable."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 88 
// DisplayName :
"P1395001201" "Lev Disk"
// DisplayHelp :
"P379490787" "The Gold Brickers' jetpacks allow them to make quick escapes as they plunder the businesses of Aeon City, but sometimes they can't carry as much as they'd like. It appears that this lev disk is designed to help lift their ill-gotten goods from the rooftop"
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 89 
// DisplayName :
"P2928034892" "Luddite Pouch"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P1975796594" "Luddite Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1305782854" "The Luddites carry numerous items of interest in these small leather bags."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 90 
// DisplayName :
"P53598444" "Magical Artifact"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3474396688" "The magical properties of this artifact are as yet untested, but should prove significant."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 91 
// DisplayName :
"P49494378" "Magical Ward"
// DisplayHelp :
"P874369608" "Powerful spells were necessary to create this ward."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 92 
// DisplayName :
"P1118134786" "Magma"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P3100161527" "Igneous Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1212239467" "This molten rock crackles and hisses with energy. No matter how long you carry it, it never cools."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 93 
// DisplayName :
"P2967897668" "Meat Cleaver"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3815826630" "The ceramics used to form this blade allow it to remain sharp forever. Such material no doubt has many uses."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 94 
// DisplayName :
"P687384027" "Mercury Circuits"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1760976213" "These look like microcircuits, but are far more sophisticated. Such circuits are necessary to produce the high quality AI that makes Council robots and turrets so deadly."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 95 
// DisplayName :
"P859120405" "Military Intelligence"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1623559921" "Some para-military groups are extremely efficient at gathering intel on their foes. The Knives of Artemis and the Malta Group are particularly adept at this."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 96 
// DisplayName :
"P52061707" "Mutated Sample"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P810583484" "Mutant Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2160744025" "This tissue sample is clearly abnormal. It could hold the key to some future discovery."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 97 
// DisplayName :
"P2773332514" "Mystic Element"
// DisplayHelp :
"P210173322" "This substance is not of this world."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 98 
// DisplayName :
"P1274419854" "Mystic Foci"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3463943538" "The very air around this vibrates with power."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 99 
// DisplayName :
"P2829190120" "Nanites"
// DisplayHelp :
"P265847051" "Microchips? Phah! Microscopic machines are the wave of the future! They are already in use as medical aids by such groups as Freedom Corps and the Knives of Artemis."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 100 
// DisplayName :
"P1019782635" "Necklace of Teeth"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3430063229" "This necklace is made of human teeth. You don't want to know where or how the Shamans got them."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 101 
// DisplayName :
"P3444274177" "Nemesis Staff"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2866992640" "The Nemesis Staff generates immense power, though, like all Nemesis' creations, it is based on steam technology."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 102 
// DisplayName :
"P12206239" "Nemesis Weapon"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3634970312" "Most engineers would agree that steam technology is hopelessly out of date, but not Nemesis. Truly, it is amazing how he has adapted such an old technology to modern warfare."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 103 
// DisplayName :
"P13852036" "Neo Organics"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3371342927" "By studying the DNA of nonhuman groups such as the Devouring Earth and the Hydra Men, it's possible to learn much about the process of evolution."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 104 
// DisplayName :
"P325136219" "Nictus Ammo"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P2122499178" "Nictus Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P853632870" "This ammunition, taken from a Quantum Gun, is specially designed to destroy Kheldian heroes. One Peacebringer said after being shot with such ammunition that it was as if his human and Kheldian selves were being ripped apart."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 105 
// DisplayName :
"P660103071" "Nictus Memento"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2433024315" "This box, carried by a Quantum Gunner, appears empty. However, traces of a living Nictus can be found inside."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 106 
// DisplayName :
"P2052219235" "Nictus Tech"
// DisplayHelp :
"P705683260" "A fragment of a Quantum Gunner, this technology is engineered to rip Kheldian heroes apart."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 107 
// DisplayName :
"P4182730263" "Vahzilok Notes"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P1130481278" "Meat Doctors Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3847600075" "The Meat Doctors have taken Dr. Vahzilok's techniques and combined them with the quick and dirty procedures perfected by the Freakshow. The result is a brutal efficiency."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 108 
// DisplayName :
"P1028345022" "Orichalcum"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1609135585" "This is a crystal used in ancient times. Engineers cannot account for its unusual strength, which is believed by some to be mystically enhanced."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 109 
// DisplayName :
"P1032861971" "Paragon Police Files"
// DisplayHelp :
"P137539291" "These files belong to the Paragon Police department. No doubt they were smuggled out by one of the officers on the Family's payroll."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 110 
// DisplayName :
"P2981820467" "Wolf Pelt"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P2318603681" "Council Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2833765417" "Some say that magic is involved in the creation of the Council's War Wolves, but others insist that Kheldian technology plays a role in their transformation."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 111 
// DisplayName :
"P1676077628" "Phantom Tears"
// DisplayHelp :
"P647727783" "The teardrop of a ghost! Deep emotion is often what ties ghosts to this world."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 112 
// DisplayName :
"P1365680200" "Portal Tech"
// DisplayHelp :
"P657245845" "Portal Corporation has been the source of many technological advances, but there are those who say that such knowledge is not worth the risk involved in exposing our dimension to all the dangers of the multiverse."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 113 
// DisplayName :
"P1293596059" "Potion"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3165328954" "Potions such as these are very dangerous if you don't know what they do. Of course, for some groups like the Carnival, the chaos is part of the fun."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 114 
// DisplayName :
"P4202512411" "Powered Armor Circuitry"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2261791856" "This circuit plate is capable of sending an electrical charge through a suit of body armor, which can administer a shock to anyone who strikes it."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 115 
// DisplayName :
"P782104602" "Clockwork Plate"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P2366667141" "Clockwork Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2775414342" "Many of the Clockwork have these simple metal plates. As far as engineers can tell, they serve no useful purpose."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 116 
// DisplayName :
"P836803475" "Clockwork Fragment"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2729610294" "This chunk of iron must be an extraneous part. It can't possibly have any function."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 117 
// DisplayName :
"P1899803689" "Pumice"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1027421587" "This chunk of rock is surprisingly light. That could explain why the Pumicites move with such frightening speed."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 118 
// DisplayName :
"P2106118919" "Pumpkin Bomb"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1375640485" "Like so much in Croatoa, these pumpkins are not what they first appear. Transformed by the Fir Bolg's magic, these explosive squash pack a real punch."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 119 
// DisplayName :
"P2305371075" "Fir Bolg Hand"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3672264386" "Detached from the Fir Bolg, these twisted vines have lost all semblance of life."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 120 
// DisplayName :
"P3299084286" "Redcap Pouch"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3926484084" "Curious rocks, leaves, and powders fill this small pouch, but what is most disturbing are the hard little shards of white bone. Red Caps have been known throughout history as brutal creatures, and you have to wonder who those bones once belonged to."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 121 
// DisplayName :
"P2429460755" "Rikti Armor Fragment"
// DisplayHelp :
"P4195175837" "This armor is no longer useful for combat, but the alien metals it is made of are stronger even than steel."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 122 
// DisplayName :
"P3928115668" "Rikti Communications Device"
// DisplayHelp :
"P545057921" "Few people have ever seen a Rikti speak aloud. It is possible that this communicator picks up some type of signal other than audio."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 123 
// DisplayName :
"P217902685" "Rikti Control Unit"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2182086688" "Heroes in combat have reported that Rikti monkeys react to signals from devices such as these."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 124 
// DisplayName :
"P1757415018" "Rikti Data Pad"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3322119509" "Deciphering alien engineering is no mean feat, but the knowledge gained can lead to great advances in Earth computers."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 125 
// DisplayName :
"P3606536800" "Rikti Plasma Rifle"
// DisplayHelp :
"P260965884" "Rikti plasma rifles are highly valued on the black market. The government does what it can to suppress the illegal sale of Rikti technology, but somehow it always manages to get into the hands of the people who want it."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 126 
// DisplayName :
"P3528835965" "Rikti Plasma Weapon"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2430726169" "People have lost their lives trying to recover mined weapons from former Rikti bases. Despite the traps the aliens often place on their weapons, scavengers persist because their finds bring such ready cash."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 127 
// DisplayName :
"P804149832" "Ring"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3080970896" "Rings are often said to be sources of power. Those carried by the Circle of Thorns usually bear sigils intended to bind ghostly forms to the physical world. It's hard to explain why."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 128 
// DisplayName :
"P554478676" "R'yleh's Rain"
// DisplayHelp :
"P4196051514" "These small vials of dark green liquid hold something called 'R'yleh's Rain.' Though recipes for the liquid have been recovered from Legacy tomes, it has never been successfully reproduced by someone who is not a member of one of the bloodlines of the Leg"
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 129 
// DisplayName :
"P3621339868" "Saber"
// DisplayHelp :
"P4214084007" "These ghostly blades appear to have no substance, but when wielded in fury they can cut through solid objects. That is a mystery worth analyzing."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 130 
// DisplayName :
"P108815631" "Saints Medallion"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P1793268825" "Luddites Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2114892862" "The Luddites believe that Dr. Aeon's Power Transfer System is corrupting their home. To their minds, faith is far more valuable than science."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 131 
// DisplayName :
"P1401536074" "Scent of Brimstone"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2060890327" "The smell is terrible, but arcane texts indicate that a whiff of brimstone can awaken dormant magic powers hidden within other objects."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 132 
// DisplayName :
"P399949159" "Freakshow Scrap"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P420019967" "Dark Freakshow Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1804560376" "Bitterly cold to the touch, this metal was used to form implants for Freakshow fused with Nictus fragments."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 133 
// DisplayName :
"P2700030771" "Scrolls"
// DisplayHelp :
"P740575000" "These scrolls record the spells the Tsoo use to summon their ancestors."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 134 
// DisplayName :
"P2859737402" "Shillelagh"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3447309146" "This little stick seems to cause far more harm than its size would allow. Deciphering the enchantments on it may yield something useful."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 135 
// DisplayName :
"P2613929226" "Shivan Ectoplasm"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2141615038" "The viscous goo taken from the fallen Shivan seems to still be alive. Left alone, it can move of its own accord."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 136 
// DisplayName :
"P3972544249" "Sigil"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3585501494" "Banished Pantheon shamans draw sigils such as this one onto the skin of corpses. Only then can they be animated."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 137 
// DisplayName :
"P877949049" "Sky Raider Anti Grav Unit"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P2557314202" "Sky Raider Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P663415637" "As former military men, the Sky Raiders are used to working with good equipment. It's unknown how they manage to keep their supply lines open, but these aerial mercenaries never seem to lack for anything."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 138 
// DisplayName :
"P2944111354" "Sky Raider Device"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3599426052" "Sky Raiders are notorious for their portable force fields. Most adventurers facing a group of Sky Raiders know to take out the force field generators first."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 139 
// DisplayName :
"P3479667602" "Sky Raider Weapon"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1007282900" "This sub-machine gun was manufactured by the U.S. military. How did it get into the Sky Raiders' hands?"
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 140 
// DisplayName :
"P1909969168" "Slag Culture"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P1110181794" "Slag Golem Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3182135925" "Is it magic or science that animates the Slag Golems of Sharkhead Isle? Perhaps these metal shavings can point at the answer."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 141 
// DisplayName :
"P4139913976" "Snake Fang"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P2969186704" "Snake Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P4266424954" "The hollow teeth of the Snakes ooze venom -- just like those of real vipers. Though the creatures seem to have human intelligence and knowledge of human culture, they are clearly beasts."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 142 
// DisplayName :
"P1976221833" "Snake Venom"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1922241664" "Snake bites often cause severe reactions in those with super powers. In Lord Recluse's eye, that makes them the perfect foe to test new arrivals against."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 143 
// DisplayName :
"P1557323817" "Spark"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P809791213" "Cap Au Demon Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P858398339" "Dr. Aeon has done everything he can to keep knowledge of the Cap au Diable demons from Arachnos. If he knew you were carrying evidence of their existence, your life wouldn't be worth much."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 144 
// DisplayName :
"P2407205485" "Spells"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1854326495" "It is said that the Circle has vast halls filled with tomes like this one. In this volume, several methods of ritual sacrifice are discussed."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 145 
// DisplayName :
"P1060822965" "Spider Eye"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1693877954" "Certain Arachnos personnel have miniature cameras built into their visors. Is this because they wish to record their activities, or because Lord Recluse does not trust them to operate without oversight?"
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 146 
// DisplayName :
"P4049996206" "Spielman's Signet"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3339871895" "Spielman was one of the original founders of the Legacy Chain; over the centuries, many of his descendants have died in the service of his cause."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 147 
// DisplayName :
"P552045883" "Spirit Guide"
// DisplayHelp :
"P799363987" "Even death could not stop the scholar Randall from completing his great work. This essential mystic resource lists every spirit type, from the Spectral Pirates of Cap au Diable to the ghosts that haunt Croatoa."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 148 
// DisplayName :
"P709703024" "Stable Protonium"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3244873376" "This rare element radiates great power yet is safe enough to hold in your hand."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 149 
// DisplayName :
"P1889296950" "Static Charge"
// DisplayHelp :
"P4249429353" "For some reason, this static charge does not dissipate. It is as though it has a life of its own."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 150 
// DisplayName :
"P212917799" "Steam Tech Implant"
// DisplayHelp :
"P81703351" "Nemesis is a master of intricate machines. Since before the Civil War, he has been constructing devices that confound today's most talented engineers."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 151 
// DisplayName :
"P3019414114" "Superadine Extract"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P3633451409" "Troll Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1897354825" "This extract is one of the critical components of Superadine, the drug that mutates the Trolls."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 152 
// DisplayName :
"P1474572629" "Synthetic Drug"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P3416181625" "Science Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2337297218" "Cursory examination suggests this is not any drug on the market now. If you had to guess, you'd say it was the work of someone with access to a lot of technology, and a lot of money. Someone like Countess Crey, perhaps."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 153 
// DisplayName :
"P1910741498" "Synthetic Organs"
// DisplayHelp :
"P407892261" "These synthetic organs are remarkable but unreliable. No doctor with any ethics could install such a device into a patient's body."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 154 
// DisplayName :
"P2649947809" "Talisman"
// DisplayHelp :
"P100651075" "Those who wear talismans such as this one seem to gain in magical power. However, those around them often suffer decreased power."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 155 
// DisplayName :
"P172116313" "Tattoo"
// DisplayHelp :
"P180136021" "This tattoo pattern is favored by the Hellions. It is rumored to unlock hidden powers."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 156 
// DisplayName :
"P2643223228" "Tech Hardware"
// DisplayHelp :
"P176352447" "It takes a degree of skill to build such advanced equipment."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 157 
// DisplayName :
"P531365577" "Tech Material"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2985436867" "This material has been engineered to withstand the harshest conditions, a useful property for base items."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 158 
// DisplayName :
"P142210042" "Tech Power"
// DisplayHelp :
"P869486983" "This is a highly advanced power circuit, far more efficient than even the best commercial models."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 159 
// DisplayName :
"P3251917488" "Tech Prototype"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1458861277" "If everything has been engineered properly, this prototype will work flawlessly."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 160 
// DisplayName :
"P348513171" "Tech Software"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1426627529" "All the hardware in the world is useless without good code."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 161 
// DisplayName :
"P1564619402" "Thorn Fragment"
// DisplayHelp :
"P519149769" "This thorn fragment seems to pulse in your hands. It must contain great power."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 162 
// DisplayName :
"P2749727770" "Tissue Sample"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P1151186142" "Giant Octopus Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1994759456" "An octopus this size is not natural! Surely something must have affected its growth."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 163 
// DisplayName :
"P1664473728" "Titanium"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1404303384" "Lightweight titanium is used in many modern devices. Even the Clockwork have been known to make use of the material whenever possible."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 164 
// DisplayName :
"P2089481015" "Tools of the Trade"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P958096799" "Scrapyarder Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3370214050" "The Scrapyarders wield simple weapons, but they do so with a passion that often gives them untold reserves of strength."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 165 
// DisplayName :
"P2839763909" "Treatise"
// DisplayHelp :
"P543172639" "The Luddites never go long without extolling the virtues of Martin Henri's treatise on the evils of modern technology."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 166 
// DisplayName :
"P2216630879" "Trick Arrows"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2176346540" "No one wields a bow better than Wyvern. Their arrows are far more sophisticated than simple wood; often they are wonders of technology."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 167 
// DisplayName :
"P1969836664" "Tsoo Ink"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3456277082" "This ink is used in the tattooing of the Green Ink Men, famous for their supernatural strength."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 168 
// DisplayName :
"P2141247985" "Ur-Metal"
// DisplayHelp :
"P91929271" "This rare ore comes from mines in another dimension."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 169 
// DisplayName :
"P4107517892" "Vacuum Circuits"
// DisplayHelp :
"P129278279" "These vacuum pumps are archaic in design and yet still ahead of our time!"
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 170 
// DisplayName :
"P447967176" "Verminous Victuals"
// DisplayHelp :
"P510534647" "It takes a strong stomach to look at this vile stew. You can't be sure, but it appears that a Red Cap hat floats within the broth."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 171 
// DisplayName :
"P225202918" "Witch's Hat"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2516888812" "The inner band of this hat is covered with small sigils of power. If you hold in in the darkness, these sigils faintly glow."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 172 
// DisplayName :
"P334879149" "Spells of Power"
// DisplayHelp :
"P522763359" "These incantations are stronger than any you have found before. Correctly done, they can enchant devices with deadly energies."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 173 
// DisplayName :
"P895475139" "Unstable Rad Pistol"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3412918775" "This experimental pistol was a failed attempt to create a deadly radiation gun. Too dangerous to use, it is still an engineering feat."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 174 
// DisplayName :
"P1359469004" "Weapon of Mu"
// DisplayHelp :
"P469248780" "This rare weapon is an artifact of ancient Mu. It has survived the millennia because of its arcane energies. If this power is transferred to another shell it can make a powerful device."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 175 
// DisplayName :
"P3397037972" "Alien Tech"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2998080803" "Lately there have been reports of new alien devices, not Kheldian but something else. This must be one of those. Crack its secrets and who knows what you will learn."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 176 
// DisplayName :
"P2638969719" "Nano Fluid"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3321346642" "The contents of this test tube is the result of years of research. It is a suspension of nanotech computing machines, capable performing operations of great power at blinding speeds."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 177 
// DisplayName :
"P3010592071" "Access Bypass"
// DisplayTabName :
"P2211841663" "Special"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P3577607189" "Uncommon Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P4045227370" "This salvage allows you to replace the need for one Scientist to get the launch code for the rocket in Warburg."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 178 
// DisplayName :
"P3216073478" "Prototype Element"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2948577888" "This salvage allows you to replace the need for one Core Sample to process the ore in Bloody Bay."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 179 
// DisplayName :
"P1258923966" "Statesman Halloween Mask"
// DisplayTabName :
"P4201588131" "Event"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P1128742241" "Event Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P70974804" "This is a Halloween mask of the famous hero Statesman. It's made of cheap plastic, and the flimsy string probably won't last through the night. To earn a reward, Heroes can deliver this to Annah in Croatoa, while Villains can visit Granny Beldam in Nerva Archipelago and Praetorians can go to Acantha in Imperial City."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 180 
// DisplayName :
"P4203802756" "Lord Recluse Halloween Mask"
// DisplayHelp :
"P318065096" "This is a Halloween mask of the infamous Lord Recluse. It's made of smelly rubber, and wearing it makes you all sweaty and hard to find your breath. To earn a reward, Heroes can deliver this to Annah in Croatoa, while Villains can visit Granny Beldam in Nerva Archipelago and Praetorians can go to Acantha in Imperial City."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 181 
// DisplayName :
"P3662360509" "Back Alley Brawler Halloween Gloves"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3561638149" "These are rubber Back Alley Brawler gloves, perfect for a Halloween costume. Their manufacture makes it difficult to perform simple tasks like opening doors. To earn a reward, Heroes can deliver this to Annah in Croatoa, while Villains can visit Granny Beldam in Nerva Archipelago and Praetorians can go to Acantha in Imperial City."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 182 
// DisplayName :
"P833710696" "Hamidon Halloween Costume"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3164217154" "The most popular Halloween costume among the kids of Paragon City is that of the Hamidon. This simple costume is made from colored plastic wrap. Many kids like to put action figures of their favorite heroes inside the wrap, pretending they are 'raiding' for 'Hami-O's'. To earn a reward, Heroes can deliver this to Annah in Croatoa, while Villains can visit Granny Beldam in Nerva Archipelago and Praetorians can go to Acantha in Imperial City."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

