// DisplayDropMessage :
"P534583543" "Notice of the Well Bonded"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3418007153" "You have drawn the notice of the Well of the Furies via your actions following the subtle directives and incentives it has been spreading in the worlds. This notice will allow you to construct an Alpha Incarnate Ability of Rare quality."
