// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 345 
// DisplayName :
"P1392156869" "Enhancement Converter"
// DisplayDropMessage :
"P1457699702" "Enhancement Converter Found"
// DisplayHelp :
"P902189120" "A small number of this salvage can be used to convert an set enhancement for another enhancement within the same set.  Alternatively, a larger number of this salvage can be used to convert a set enhancement for another set enhancement of the same rarity."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 346 
// DisplayName :
"P2824012308" "Enhancement Booster"
// DisplayDropMessage :
"P223811715" "Enhancement Booster Found"
// DisplayHelp :
"P510172058" "An Enhancement Booster can be combined with an Invention Origin enhancement to increase their effective level by 1.  Each enhancement can be boosted up to 5 times this way.  <br><br>To use this salvage, enter your enhancement management screen.  Click on the power that contains the slotted Invention Origin enhancement.  Once in the combine screen, click on the enhancement you wish to boost.  This will cause the enhancement to slide into the left combine slot and will cause the Enhancement Booster salvage to appear in this screen.  Click the Enhancement Booster to cause it to slide into the right combine slot.  Click Combine to complete."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 347 
// DisplayName :
"P2316632110" "Enhancement Unslotter"
// DisplayDropMessage :
"P1472264775" "Enhancement Unslotter Found"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3946482505" "This salvage can be used to bring a slotted enhancement into the user's enhancement tray.  A single Enhancement Slotter will be consumed for each enhancement that is unslotted.  <br><br>To use, simply drag a slotted enhancement from the power in which it is slotted, to an open enhancement tray slot."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 348 
// DisplayName :
"P3912664203" "Enhancement Catalyst"
// DisplayDropMessage :
"P2724272609" "Enhancement Catalyst Found"
// DisplayHelp :
"P648188752" "This salvage can be combined in the Enhancement management screen, with a slotted Archetype Origin Enhancement if the character is level 50.  This will result in a superior version of that Archetype Origin Enhancement that has significantly improved stats and set bonuses.  <br><br>To use this salvage, enter your enhancement management screen.  Click on the power that contains the slotted Archetype Origin enhancement.  Once in the combine screen, click on the enhancement you wish to upgrade.  This will cause the enhancement to slide into the left combine slot and will cause the Enhancement Catalyst salvage to appear in this screen.  Click the Enhancement Catalyst to cause it to slide into the right combine slot.  Click Combine to complete."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 349 
// DisplayName :
"P518855353" "Super Pack: Heroes and Villains"
// DisplayDropMessage :
"P409895648" "Super Pack Obtained"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P4022373562" "Super Pack"
// DisplayHelp :
"P841850475" "5 random rewards can be claimed by right clicking on this piece of salvage and selecting "Open" from the menu.  Super Packs can contain valuable consumable items like: Enhancement Boosters, Enhancement Unslotters, Costume Pieces, Archetype Origin Enhancements and much much more."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 350 
// DisplayName :
"P1212378877" "Ultimate Super Pack: Heroes and Villains"
// DisplayHelp :
"P602790831" "5 random rewards can be claimed by right clicking on this piece of salvage and selecting "Open" from the menu.  Super Packs can contain valuable consumable items like: Enhancement Boosters, Enhancement Unslotters, Costume Pieces, Archetype Origin Enhancements and much much more.  Ultimate Super Packs contain a larger quantity of rare rewards and are guaranteed to grant a Very Rare reward."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

