// DisplayName :
"P797087316" "Alignment Mission Reset"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3840050228" "Right clicking and selecting 'Open' in this special salvage's menu will remove all daily lockouts on Alignment Missions, thus allowing you to continue to complete Alignment Missions and earn credit toward completing your Morality Mission."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

