// Salvage - Sheet Salvage, Row 355 
// DisplayName :
"P2399785800" "Empyrean Reset"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1506662111" "Right clicking and selecting 'Open' in this special salvage's menu will remove all daily lockouts on earning Empyrean Merits in Incarnate Trials."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

